cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Special Education Due Process Complaint Drafter"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin and skill that drafts an IDEA special education due
  process complaint (34 C.F.R. § 300.508) from a folder of school documents —
  IEPs, evaluations, prior written notices, progress reports, service logs and
  correspondence — for any of the 50 US states and the District of Columbia.
  Every date, figure and quotation is checked against the documents or the
  person's own statement, the filing state's procedure is looked up on its
  official pages, and the draft is reviewed for errors before it is delivered as
  a PDF to file and a Word file to edit.
authors:
  - given-names: Mark
    family-names: Beekman
repository-code: "https://github.com/b33kman/special-education-due-process-complaint"
url: "https://github.com/b33kman/special-education-due-process-complaint"
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - special education
  - due process complaint
  - IDEA
  - Individuals with Disabilities Education Act
  - IEP
  - special education law
  - legal drafting
  - Claude Code plugin
